data: {"id": "f0f030e4711848a3-thinking-parallel_evidence-11953", "run_id": "f0f030e4711848a3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "用户要求调查 `aiops-case-11/workload` Pod，其初始状态为 Terminating。需要判断其当前异常、已恢复或证据不足。\n上游候选根因是 \"TerminatingStuck 的直接原因待验证\"。\n\n我已获取了以下工具结果：\n1.  `kubernetes_jq_query`: 失败 (jq error)。\n2.  `query_pod_logs`: 成功，返回了 5 条匹配日志。\n3.  `execute_pod_promql`: 成功，但结果为空 (`coverage: empty`)，未找到 memory usage 数据。\n4.  `query_pod_topology`: 成功，返回了拓扑信息 (owner, node, etc.)。\n5.  `kubectl_get_yaml`: 成功，显示了详细的 YAML，包括 `deletionTimestamp`, `finalizers`, `containerStatuses` 等。\n6.  `kubectl_describe`: 成功，显示 status: Terminating，exitCode: ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788822927098, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

