认根因**：Pod 资源清理阻塞的直接原因是存在自定义 Finalizer `aiops.lab/hold`，该 Finalizer 在容器被终止后未被及时移除，导致 Kubernetes API Server 无法完成该 Pod 资源的最终删除流程。\n- **未知部分**：持有 `aiops.lab/hold` 的控制器或 Webhook 的具体业务逻辑及其为何未能在合理时间内清理该 Finalizer。\n- **证据支撑**：\n    - `Pod Terminating` 状态 (#1) 与 `exit_code: 137` (#2) 证实了终止机制的触发。\n    - `Finalizer` 相关的未知逻辑是官方 RCA 中唯一指向 Terminating 阻塞的原因，现有工具事实（K8s Events, Logs, Traces）未提供该 Finalizer 清理失败的具体日志或调用链。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 4.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 226.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 226.3s (Evidence 218.6s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 257.03, "metrics": {"run_id": "f0f030e4711848a3", "mttr": {"value": "4.3m", "seconds": 257.0372598171234, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score",